 "notes": "Spine: need -> hypothesis -> WPU base + FGO/PANI_PA filler + ratio sweep -> GO grafting -> PANI_PA polymerisation -> emulsify/coat -> NaCl immersion; STR (PA-doped PANI, PANI on FGO, Fe3O4 and [FenPA2] products) -> barrier/passivation/chelation MECs -> retained Rc/Rct/Cc (PRP) and 2.5 wt% optimum -> 60-d protection -> synergy conclusion. Control branch: FGO/PANI_HCl (residual Cl) contrasts. Audits: o21 (day-0 ranking contradicts 2.5 wt% maximum), o24 (no post-40 d recovery for the 2.5 wt% composite, weakening passivation evidence for the composite). Lost: GO vs FGO dispersion and GO micro-galvanic argument, UV-vis, FGO wrinkling/AFM thickness (2.51 nm on image vs 2.52 text).",
